## 🔐 Sprint 2 - Login og Autentificering

### `auth.ts` - Autentificering
Jeg kodede `auth.ts` fordi systemet havde brug for sikker brugeradgang. Filen indeholder:
- bcrypt password hashing
- JWT token generation
- Session management med express-session
- Passport.js integration

```typescript
// Password hashing og verifikation
export const hashPassword = async (password: string): Promise<string> => {
  return await bcrypt.hash(password, 10);
};

export const verifyPassword = async (password: string, hash: string): Promise<boolean> => {
  return await bcrypt.compare(password, hash);
};
```

### Login System Implementation
- Sikker session håndtering
- Cookie-baseret autentificering
- Protection af API endpoints

